    <ChoiceInput>
      <Key>'The Devil in Peter'</Key>
      <Distractor>The fairies</Distractor>
      <Distractor>The pipe</Distractor>
    </ChoiceInput>
    <Explanation>
      <Markdown>Frampton made six other full-size casts from the original moulds and small bronzes in 1913-28. Barrie was disappointed with the statue, saying it did not show 'the Devil in Peter'. It is listed Grade II* (1970).</Markdown>
      <Markdown>Wikipedia only (statue). Listing grade as stated; the quotation as paraphrased by the article.</Markdown>
      <Markdown>*Source: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_Pan_statue (confidence: medium)*</Markdown>
    </Explanation>
  </KeyGrader>
