<CapaProblem id="uk_pol_flag_1801" title="The Union Jack" dontKnow="true">
  <KeyGrader>
    <Markdown>When was St Patrick's cross added to the Union Flag?</Markdown>
    <ChoiceInput>
      <Distractor>1707</Distractor>
      <Distractor>1922</Distractor>
      <Key>1801, with the union of Great Britain and Ireland</Key>
      <Distractor>1606</Distractor>
    </ChoiceInput>
    <Explanation>
      <Markdown>The current design dates from 1801, when the Act of Union with Ireland (1800) took effect (proclamation of 1 January 1801) and St Patrick's saltire was added to the 1606 flag.</Markdown>
      <Markdown>gov.uk says the first Union Flag (1606) combined the flags of England and Scotland and the present flag dates from 1801. The 1 January proclamation is from Wikipedia.</Markdown>
      <Markdown>*Source: https://www.gov.uk/guidance/designated-days-for-union-flag-flying (confidence: high)*</Markdown>
    </Explanation>
  </KeyGrader>
</CapaProblem>

<CapaProblem id="uk_pol_flag_wales" title="The Union Jack" dontKnow="true">
