      <Distractor>Yes, always</Distractor>
      <Distractor>Only on land</Distractor>
    </ChoiceInput>
    <Explanation>
      <Markdown>The names Union Flag and Union Jack are both acceptable; the Admiralty accepted either in 1902. "Jack" probably derives from the small flag flown on a ship's bow.</Markdown>
